      <TableCell>Name of an existing LokiStack resource to use.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>namespace</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Namespace where this <code>LokiStack</code> resource is located. If omitted, it is assumed to be the same as <code>spec.namespace</code>. When configuring a different namespace, the operator watches certificate secret and copies it to the netobserv main namespaces. In order to do so, you must grant it permissions to the <code>netobserv-secret-watcher</code> and <code>netobserv-secret-creator</code> roles in the corresponding namespaces. Refer to the Loki configuration documentation for more information.</TableCell>
